    "海猫与海鸥的海岸时光",
    "Coastal Cats and Gulls at Leisure"
  ],
  "brief": [
    "“观察一只停在岸边晒太阳的猫和一只在沙滩上悠闲徘徊的海鸥。静静地感受它们的自在时光，无需打扰。完成后回来分享。”",
    "\"Watch a cat sun-resting by the shore and a gull wandering on the beach. Quietly enjoy their peaceful moments without disturbance. Share your observations when done.\""
  ],
  "page": [
    "我和Owen分享了海岸两种生物的闲适光景。猫在岸边的阳光下慵懒地休息，而海鸥则在沙滩上悠闲地游走。它们各自自在，互不干扰。",
    "Owen and I shared a peaceful coastal scene: a cat lazily sunning itself by the shore, while a gull wandered leisurely on the beach. Both creatures at ease, undisturbed by each other."
  ],
